                    <string>Cache,Capacity,Allocated,Available,Largest Free Space,Raw Capacity,Raw Allocated,Raw Available,Virtual Capacity,Known Virtual Capacity,License Capacity,Usable Internal Capacity,Usable External Capacity,Virtualized Capacity,Virtualized Capacity Thin,Usable Used Capacity,Usable Free Capacity,LUN Capacity,LUN Allocated,LUN Unallocated,Thin Pool Capacity,Thin Pool Allocated,Thin Pool Available,Thin Pool Subscribed</string>
                  </entry>
